{"synopsis":"Kehidupan Na Hae-soo berubah ketika suaminya mengkhianatinya dengan berselingkuh, membuatnya terlilit hutang dan kehilangan anak mereka. Setelah itu, ia mendapati suaminya bersama seorang wanita yang lebih muda. Dengan perasaan hancur dan putus asa, Na Hae-soo merasa kehidupannya di sekelilingnya runtuh dan hancur. Namun, seorang pemuda misterius tiba-tiba memasuki hidupnya, meminta untuk diajari tentang cinta orang dewasa. Keluguan dan ketulusannya mulai mengusik emosi dalam diri Na Hae-soo, dan menantangnya untuk mempertimbangkan kembali langkah apa yang akan diambil.","alternative_title":"시든 꽃에 눈물을","author":"Gae","artist":"Gae","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"83320d78-e9af-41af-b3c0-66dc4c627ffe","number":"110","chapter":"110","title":"Chapter 110","date":"2026-07-21","released":"2026-07-21","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"848b835f-777b-4932-bb74-30c07395b22a","number":"109","chapter":"109","title":"Chapter 109","date":"2026-07-11","released":"2026-07-11","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"15df5650-b2d2-422f-9c0e-f0e9287f94fe","number":"108","chapter":"108","title":"Chapter 108","date":"2026-07-05","released":"2026-07-05","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ca71c276-83b0-4abf-a665-3d27485cac69","number":"107","chapter":"107","title":"Chapter 107","date":"2026-07-03","released":"2026-07-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"be2fdff1-ceec-4d83-b7a2-d06d30e028d1","number":"106","chapter":"106","title":"Chapter 106","date":"2026-06-14","released":"2026-06-14","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ceb9b207-9556-4298-8fe3-d5ba94c431d0","number":"105","chapter":"105","title":"Chapter 105","date":"2026-06-14","released":"2026-06-14","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"d6e109cb-5b2a-4a93-ac9d-75e35f1c1bb2","number":"104","chapter":"104","title":"Chapter 104","date":"2026-06-14","released":"2026-06-14","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"cecc2013-1a8f-4918-a693-547f6d3a0f01","number":"103","chapter":"103","title":"Chapter 103","date":"2026-06-07","released":"2026-06-07","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"6f6cc1b0-9bcd-42